Z||000007||sloth85GT||09-30-2001||06:02 PM||||I'm a natural born and raised Canadian boy, therefore, I play hockey and have since the age of 3. I play Junior here in Winnipeg for a team in the Manitoba Major Junior Hockey League called the Seven Oaks Raiders. It's a pretty competative team, I have fun, I also coach 8 year olds hockey because I want to pass on how much fun I had at that age with my coaches. Hockey is not only the fastest game on earth, it's also the best. And in the words of Joe in the Molson commercials.....I AM CANADIAN!!!! <P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif">     <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||1
